### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3001/api/health

### Get All Inventory
GET http://localhost:3001/api/inventory

### Get Inventory by Category A
GET http://localhost:3001/api/inventory?category=A

### Get All SKUs
GET http://localhost:3001/api/skus

### Search SKUs
GET http://localhost:3001/api/skus?search=marble

### Get All Warehouses
GET http://localhost:3001/api/warehouses

### Get Transactions
GET http://localhost:3001/api/transactions?limit=10

### Get Analytics Summary
GET http://localhost:3001/api/analytics/summary

### Get Low Stock Items
GET http://localhost:3001/api/analytics/low-stock

### Get Inventory Turnover (30 days)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/analytics/turnover?days=30

### Soft Allocate Stock
POST http://localhost:3001/api/inventory/{{inventory_id}}/allocate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 10,
  "reference_number": "SO-2025-001",
  "expires_in_hours": 24
}

### Receive Goods
POST http://localhost:3001/api/inventory/{{inventory_id}}/receive
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 50,
  "reference_number": "GRN-2025-001",
  "notes": "Received from JSW Steel"
}
